# Sphere-local Caddy routes — merged into the CLI-generated gateway config.
#
# Sphere-owned: the upstream template ships an empty stub and never edits it.
# Add THIS sphere's extra gateway routes here; the OduSphere CLI injects these
# tokens inside the site block, before the static catch-all.
#
# Example — proxy an extra backend path to Odoo:
#
#   @sphere_api path /myapi/*
#   handle @sphere_api {
#       reverse_proxy odoo:8069
#   }
